cial for women than men.</p></span></div><div data-rid="4be6c39b-87ff-45ad-af01-026fe5ee9b64" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-5win8d alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Most people think of creatine as something used by huge male bodybuilders to pop their pecs and boost their biceps, but creatine can actually be even more powerful and effective for women. At a basic level, you can accelerate those glute gains, but other improvements to focus and energy may help women dealing with hormonal shifts and facing broader fatigue.<br><br>Creatine also helps with muscle recovery and has huge benefits for bone density and joint health - women naturally have lower bone density than men, so paying extra attention to this area is important at all stages of life.<br><br>Taking creatine at levels under 10g per day also carries little to no risk of bloating - get that energy and those gains without feeling puffy!</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="9984e501-6f70-42a5-9d3e-7119b9e91bfc" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-1sp967w"><div class="r-1hjmsj3"><video style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:var(--rof, inherit);object-position:var(--rop, inherit)" preload="metadata" autoplay="" muted="" loop=""></video></div></div></div><div data-rid="a17c81b5-f0c1-4550-80ce-5afd33f02d84" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="benefits" tabindex="-1" id="benefits" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-stm08y"><picture data-rid="c35bd7e6-07fc-466b-aac5-593ed5ed0eda" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-y53xy7"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/abbiesmithryan.jpg?v=1731257818&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/abbiesmithryan.jpg?v=1731257818&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/abbiesmithryan.jpg?v=173125